  "content": "\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">此模組旨在<strong>加入往年遺漏的生物</strong>，同時我們也在等待官方正式發布。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><br><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;comic sans ms&#x27;, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:36px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><strong><strong>生物投票</strong></strong></span><span style=\"font-size:36px;color:#f60\"><strong><strong> 2023</strong></strong></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;comic sans ms&#x27;, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:36px;color:#f60\"><span style=\"color:#19171c\">&nbsp;</span><strong><strong><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1160546181831741440/1163843365457105006/IMG_7727.jpg?ex=65410c99&is=652e9799&hm=1b9fb057515bf1198c786e5aab99059faaf7ea973645c4129a0b02bb7a6f3326&\" alt=\"生物投票 2023\" width=\"1751\" height=\"1407\"></strong></strong></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:36px;color:#f60\"><strong><strong><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1160546181831741440/1163433289391030454/IMG_7721.jpg?ex=653f8eaf&is=652d19af&hm=cd18bf19f4d9fea49c03e6e66af705021674400501226dd710e7ace7f7dd529b&\" alt=\"犰狳\" width=\"1751\" height=\"1751\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1160546181831741440/1163433288996769842/IMG_7720.jpg?ex=653f8eaf&is=652d19af&hm=b25fb2d3f9245e82acbade109c293614389438220afd18d8fc6ea173969a3d89&\" alt=\"螃蟹\" width=\"1751\" height=\"1751\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1160546181831741440/1163433289860788224/IMG_7722.jpg?ex=653f8eaf&is=652d19af&hm=1692334680d519ae27859e0483e09cc32c191eee6cc6f92bd73b97d6e18d78df&\" alt=\"企鵝\" width=\"1751\" height=\"1751\"></strong></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>螃蟹：</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\">- 生成於紅樹林沼澤地</span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\">- 可使用海帶進行繁殖</span><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>犰狳：</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\">- 生成於熱帶草原</span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\">- 可使用蜘蛛眼進行繁殖</span><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>企鵝：</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\">- 生成於石質海岸</span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\">- 可使用鮭魚或鱈魚進行繁殖</span></p>",
